<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-RESULTS OF DUTCH CUP THIRD ROUND MATCHES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS OF DUTCH CUP THIRD ROUND MATCHES.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Dutch Cup third</p>
<p>round soccer matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p> Willem II Tilburg    2    Groningen	  0</p>
<p> PSV Eindhoven	  2    AZ Alkmaar	 3 (2-2 after 90</p>
<p>minutes, AZ won with sudden-death &quot;golden goal&quot; in extra time)</p>
